q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.209 Tw (Eddie sat in the driver's seat of the dead man's car for a long time, the photograph in his shaking) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (hands, and the whole night came back to him in pieces.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.123 Tw (The two taps on the glass. The warehouse. The man getting into the back seat. The eleven) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.942 Tw (minutes of silence. And then -- he remembered this now, and he wished he did not -- the Don) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 680.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.297 Tw (turning in his seat as the man got out, and saying, very quietly, "Nico. You would kill your own) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 660.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (father?") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 630.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (And Nico, standing in the dark lot, saying, "You were going to give it to Tommy.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 601.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.788 Tw (Tommy. The younger son. The Don had been planning to name Tommy his heir, and cut Nico) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 580.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.901 Tw (out, because Nico had been stealing from the family for years. Eddie had heard the Don say it) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 560.49 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.898 Tw (once, on the phone, in the back of this very car: "Tommy has the head for it. Nico has the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 540.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (hunger. Hunger is not leadership.") Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 510.60 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.051 Tw (So Nico had poisoned his father's medicine. A heart attack, the doctor said. A bad heart. Nobody) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 490.20 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (checked the pills, because who checks the pills of a sixty-eight-year-old man with a bad heart?) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 460.72 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.075 Tw (Eddie put the photograph in his jacket pocket and drove home. That night he could not sleep. He) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 440.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.558 Tw (thought about his wife and his daughters and his mortgage. He thought about the old Don, who) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 419.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.195 Tw (had paid for his eldest daughter's wedding. He thought about Nico, who now ran the family, and) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 399.49 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (who had killed his own father for an inheritance.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 370.01 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.249 Tw (On Sunday morning, Eddie put on his best suit. He put the photograph in his inside pocket, next) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 349.60 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.587 Tw (to his heart. And he drove to the restaurant where Nico Romano ate lunch every Sunday, at the) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 329.19 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (same table, at the same time, like his father before him.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 299.71 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.331 Tw (He walked in. The room went quiet. Nico looked up from his plate, and his face went white,) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 279.30 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.625 Tw (because he recognised the driver, and he recognised the look of a man who had finally decided) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 258.89 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (to stop being quiet.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 229.41 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.060 Tw (Eddie sat down across from him, uninvited. He set the photograph on the table, face up, between) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 209.00 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (the bread and the wine.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 179.52 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.291 Tw ("Your father left you a message, Nico," Eddie said. "Eleven minutes in the back of my car. I) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 159.11 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (remember every second of it.") Tj ET Q
